      "objective": "Form comparative adjectives with -er, including common spelling changes.",
      "description": "Short adjectives usually take -er before than.",
      "content": "Add -er to many short adjectives; change y to i before -er and double a final consonant when needed.",
      "examples": [
        "This road is wider than that road.",
        "English is easier than maths for me."
      ],
